fice/word/2020/wordml/sdtdatahash" xmlns:w16sdtfl="http://schemas.microsoft.com/office/word/2024/wordml/sdtformatlock" xmlns:w16se="http://schemas.microsoft.com/office/word/2015/wordml/symex" xmlns:wpg="http://schemas.microsoft.com/office/word/2010/wordprocessingGroup" xmlns:wpi="http://schemas.microsoft.com/office/word/2010/wordprocessingInk" xmlns:wne="http://schemas.microsoft.com/office/word/2006/wordml" xmlns:wps="http://schemas.microsoft.com/office/word/2010/wordprocessingShape" mc:Ignorable="w14 w15 w16se w16cid w16 w16cex w16sdtdh w16sdtfl w16du wp14"><w:body><w:p w14:paraId="459DF1D1" w14:textId="56B75B5F" w:rsidR="004F1372" w:rsidRPr="00D57C35" w:rsidRDefault="00D57C35"><w:pPr><w:rPr><w:u w:val="single"/></w:rPr></w:pPr><w:r w:rsidRPr="00D57C35"><w:rPr><w:u w:val="single"/></w:rPr><w:t>Unity</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p w14:paraId="5191886B" w14:textId="252A8880" w:rsidR="00D57C35" w:rsidRDefault="00D57C35"><w:pPr><w:rPr><w:b/><w:bCs/></w:rPr></w:pPr><w:r w:rsidRPr="00D57C35"><w:rPr><w:b/><w:bCs/></w:rPr><w:t>Magical Maze: Heart and Key Quest</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p w14:paraId="21769C4D" w14:textId="1EBEE12F" w:rsidR="00D57C35" w:rsidRDefault="00D57C35"><w:r w:rsidRPr="00D57C35"><w:t>In this fantasy adventure game, the player is trapped in a cursed forest and must complete various missions to return to the real world. The player needs to collect hearts, solve puzzles, pass through moving platforms, and avoid enemies while exploring the environment. By overcoming these challenges, the player gradually breaks the curse, restores harmony to the forest, and defeats the witch’s evil magic.</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p w14:paraId="53AC4A82" w14:textId="7B3340F2" w:rsidR="00D57C35" w:rsidRDefault="00D57C35"><w:hyperlink r:id="rId4" w:history="1"><w:r w:rsidRPr="001577FB"><w:rPr><w:rStyle w:val="Hyperlink"/></w:rPr><w:t>https://youtu.be/cVqptUrSHuU</w:t></w:r></w:hyperlink></w:p><w:p w14:paraId="702D2F41" w14:textId="77777777" w:rsidR="00D57C35" w:rsidRDefault="00D57C35"/><w:p w14:paraId="1EABB7B7" w14:textId="08600237" w:rsidR="00D57C35" w:rsidRDefault="00D57C35"><w:pPr><w:rPr><w:b/><w:bCs/></w:rPr></w:pPr><w:r w:rsidRPr="00D57C35"><w:rPr><w:b/><w:bCs/></w:rPr><w:t>Merlin’s Curse</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p w14:paraId="16E26AFA" w14:textId="77777777" w:rsidR="00D57C35" w:rsidRPr="00D57C35" w:rsidRDefault="00D57C35" w:rsidP="00D57C35"><w:pPr><w:rPr><w:lang w:val="en-GB"/></w:rPr></w:pPr><w:r w:rsidRPr="00D57C35"><w:rPr><w:lang w:val="en-GB"/></w:rPr><w:t>Merlin’s Curse is a fantasy action-adventure game that mixes puzzle-solving, fighting, and story exploration. The player controls Merlin, a boy who is trapped by a curse and guided by a mysterious woman. To escape, he must explore magical worlds, solve puzzles, and use different elemental powers to fight enemies and guardians.</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p w14:paraId="072EA7CE" w14:textId="77777777" w:rsidR="00D57C35" w:rsidRPr="00D57C35" w:rsidRDefault="00D57C35" w:rsidP="00D57C35"><w:pPr><w:rPr><w:lang w:val="en-GB"/></w:rPr></w:pPr><w:r w:rsidRPr="00D57C35"><w:rPr><w:lang w:val="en-GB"/></w:rPr><w:t>As the story continues, Merlin learns that the woman helping him is hiding a dark secret. What starts as a journey for freedom turns into a battle against betrayal and fate. The game focuses on emotional storytelling, beautiful environments, and fun gameplay that combines thinking, exploration, and action.</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p w14:paraId="46D20ABD" w14:textId="47AF27A8" w:rsidR="00D57C35" w:rsidRDefault="00D57C35"><w:pPr><w:rPr><w:lang w:val="en-GB"/></w:rPr></w:pPr><w:hyperlink r:id="rId5" w:history="1"><w:r w:rsidRPr="001577FB"><w:rPr><w:rStyle w:val="Hyperlink"/><w:lang w:val="en-GB"/></w:rPr><w:t>https://youtu.be/qOCyQi9lx44</w:t></w:r></w:hyperlink></w:p><w:p w14:paraId="3D0E44D4" w14:textId="77777777" w:rsidR="00D57C35" w:rsidRDefault="00D57C35"><w:pPr><w:rPr><w:lang w:val="en-GB"/></w:rPr></w:pPr></w:p><w:p w14:paraId="4E69A73A" w14:textId="5C58880F" w:rsidR="00D57C35" w:rsidRDefault="00D57C35"><w:pPr><w:rPr><w:b/><w:bCs/></w:rPr></w:pPr><w:r w:rsidRPr="00D57C35"><w:rPr><w:b/><w:bCs/></w:rPr><w:t>Battle Banner</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p w14:paraId="39F76103" w14:textId="4E41413A" w:rsidR="00D57C35" w:rsidRDefault="00D57C35"><w:r w:rsidRPr="00D57C35"><w:t>Battle Banner is a fast-paced 3D competitive First Person Shooter (FPS) game set in a post-apocalyptic urban battlefield. Players are divided into two small teams, each protecting their own banner while trying to steal the enemy’s banner and return it to their base.</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p w14:paraId="5CEA71D1" w14:textId="77777777" w:rsidR="00D57C35" w:rsidRDefault="00D57C35"/><w:p w14:paraId="6333F08F" w14:textId="17F92BBA" w:rsidR="00D57C35" w:rsidRDefault="00D57C35"><w:r w:rsidRPr="00D57C35"><w:t>Unlike traditional FPS games, Battle Banner emphasizes tactical movement, quick decision-making, and teamwork rather than shooting alone. With short and intense matches designed for 1–4 players per team, the game encourages cooperation, strategy, and communication. Through exciting gameplay, players learn the importance of teamwork, timing, and collaboration while enjoying a fun and competitive experience.</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p w14:paraId="05AE2324" w14:textId="186E07A5" w:rsidR="00D57C35" w:rsidRDefault="00D57C35"><w:pPr><w:rPr><w:lang w:val="en-GB"/></w:rPr></w:pPr><w:hyperlink r:id="rId6" w:history="1"><w:r w:rsidRPr="001577FB"><w:rPr><w:rStyle w:val="Hyperlink"/><w:lang w:val="en-GB"/></w:rPr><w:t>https://youtu.be/rH6oLNBAGMA</w:t></w:r></w:hyperlink></w:p><w:p w14:paraId="6576B59B" w14:textId="77777777" w:rsidR="00D57C35" w:rsidRDefault="00D57C35"><w:pPr><w:rPr><w:lang w:val="en-GB"/></w:rPr></w:pPr></w:p><w:p w14:paraId="283E34DF" w14:textId="2EF2B08C" w:rsidR="00D57C35" w:rsidRDefault="00D57C35"><w:pPr><w:rPr><w:b/><w:bCs/></w:rPr></w:pPr><w:r w:rsidRPr="00D57C35"><w:rPr><w:b/><w:bCs/></w:rPr><w:t>Lost Era: Crystal Hunt</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p w14:paraId="62324313" w14:textId="40FD8E8B" w:rsidR="00D57C35" w:rsidRDefault="00D57C35"><w:r w:rsidRPr="00D57C35"><w:lastRenderedPageBreak/><w:t xml:space="preserve">Lost Era: Crystal Hunt is a 3D multiplayer </w:t></w:r><w:proofErr w:type="spellStart"/><w:r w:rsidRPr="00D57C35"><w:t>PvE</w:t></w:r><w:proofErr w:type="spellEnd"/><w:r w:rsidRPr="00D57C35"><w:t xml:space="preserve"> game with a Historical Time Travel theme. The game places players in different historical eras where they must work together to collect scattered energy crystals while avoiding guardians without harming them.</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p w14:paraId="1276D74F" w14:textId="77777777" w:rsidR="00D57C35" w:rsidRDefault="00D57C35"/><w:p w14:paraId="3B69CDB2" w14:textId="345FA3B9" w:rsidR="00D57C35" w:rsidRDefault="00D57C35"><w:r w:rsidRPr="00D57C35"><w:t>After all crystals are collected, a countdown begins and alien enemies are released, forcing players to escape back to their spaceship before time runs out. The game emphasizes teamwork, critical thinking, and non-violent problem-solving through cooperative gameplay.</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p w14:paraId="62CFAFCE" w14:textId="1C45BB95" w:rsidR="00D57C35" w:rsidRDefault="00D57C35"><w:pPr><w:rPr><w:lang w:val="en-GB"/></w:rPr></w:pPr><w:hyperlink r:id="rId7" w:history="1"><w:r w:rsidRPr="001577FB"><w:rPr><w:rStyle w:val="Hyperlink"/><w:lang w:val="en-GB"/></w:rPr><w:t>https://youtu.be/zM_9WX858zE</w:t></w:r></w:hyperlink></w:p><w:p w14:paraId="59AA457C" w14:textId="77777777" w:rsidR="00D57C35" w:rsidRDefault="00D57C35"><w:pPr><w:rPr><w:lang w:val="en-GB"/></w:rPr></w:pPr></w:p><w:p w14:paraId="5D5D227A" w14:textId="4C707735" w:rsidR="00D57C35" w:rsidRDefault="00D57C35"><w:pPr><w:rPr><w:b/><w:bCs/></w:rPr></w:pPr><w:r w:rsidRPr="00D57C35"><w:rPr><w:b/><w:bCs/></w:rPr><w:t>Secret of the Blooded Town</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p w14:paraId="1DA7E793" w14:textId="75CA6C50" w:rsidR="00D57C35" w:rsidRDefault="00D57C35"><w:r w:rsidRPr="00D57C35"><w:t>Secret of the Blooded Town is an adventure narrative game that explores different storytelling structures through gameplay. Set in a mysterious coastal town, the game places players in the role of an investigator uncovering a series of hidden truths behind a murder case.</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p w14:paraId="0DB81906" w14:textId="40009CF6" w:rsidR="00D57C35" w:rsidRDefault="00D57C35"><w:pPr><w:rPr><w:lang w:val="en-GB"/></w:rPr></w:pPr><w:hyperlink r:id="rId8" w:history="1"><w:r w:rsidRPr="001577FB"><w:rPr><w:rStyle w:val="Hyperlink"/><w:lang w:val="en-GB"/></w:rPr><w:t>https://youtu.be/KFKfRuDl0j0</w:t></w:r></w:hyperlink></w:p><w:p w14:paraId="6B4E5F9C" w14:textId="77777777" w:rsidR="00D57C35" w:rsidRDefault="00D57C35"><w:pPr><w:rPr><w:lang w:val="en-GB"/></w:rPr></w:pPr></w:p><w:p w14:paraId="733FCD95" w14:textId="6A702B40" w:rsidR="00D57C35" w:rsidRPr="00D57C35" w:rsidRDefault="00D57C35"><w:pPr><w:rPr><w:u w:val="single"/><w:lang w:val="en-GB"/></w:rPr></w:pPr><w:r w:rsidRPr="00D57C35"><w:rPr><w:u w:val="single"/><w:lang w:val="en-GB"/></w:rPr><w:t>Unreal Engine</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p w14:paraId="2EF044DE" w14:textId="77777777" w:rsidR="00D57C35" w:rsidRDefault="00D57C35"><w:pPr><w:rPr><w:lang w:val="en-GB"/></w:rPr></w:pPr></w:p><w:p w14:paraId="407FF4FD" w14:textId="79729385" w:rsidR="00D57C35" w:rsidRDefault="00D57C35"><w:pPr><w:rPr><w:b/><w:bCs/></w:rPr></w:pPr><w:proofErr w:type="spellStart"/><w:r w:rsidRPr="00D57C35"><w:rPr><w:b/><w:bCs/></w:rPr><w:t>Lightbound</w:t></w:r><w:proofErr w:type="spellEnd"/></w:p><w:p w14:paraId="45CBD75F" w14:textId="27010CB5" w:rsidR="00D57C35" w:rsidRDefault="00D57C35"><w:proofErr w:type="spellStart"/><w:r w:rsidRPr="00D57C35"><w:t>Lightbound</w:t></w:r><w:proofErr w:type="spellEnd"/><w:r w:rsidRPr="00D57C35"><w:t xml:space="preserve"> is a puzzle-adventure experience set in a mysterious </w:t></w:r><w:proofErr w:type="gramStart"/><w:r w:rsidRPr="00D57C35"><w:t>otherworld</w:t></w:r><w:proofErr w:type="gramEnd"/><w:r w:rsidRPr="00D57C35"><w:t>. After a strange accident, the player is transformed into a glowing Seeker Orb and trapped in an unfamiliar environment.</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p w14:paraId="31605EE3" w14:textId="77777777" w:rsidR="00D57C35" w:rsidRDefault="00D57C35"/><w:p w14:paraId="7C09172B" w14:textId="516D658F" w:rsidR="00D57C35" w:rsidRDefault="00D57C35"><w:r w:rsidRPr="00D57C35"><w:t>To return to the real world, the player must explore the surroundings, solve puzzles, complete objectives, and carefully avoid enemies. Through observation, logic, and strategic movement, the player gradually uncovers the path to escape.</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p w14:paraId="092B60A9" w14:textId="5A4EBE92" w:rsidR="00D57C35" w:rsidRDefault="00D57C35"><w:pPr><w:rPr><w:lang w:val="en-GB"/></w:rPr></w:pPr><w:hyperlink r:id="rId9" w:history="1"><w:r w:rsidRPr="001577FB"><w:rPr><w:rStyle w:val="Hyperlink"/><w:lang w:val="en-GB"/></w:rPr><w:t>https://youtu.be/XsCCR_19_tc</w:t></w:r></w:hyperlink></w:p><w:p w14:paraId="28FA41DE" w14:textId="77777777" w:rsidR="00D57C35" w:rsidRDefault="00D57C35"><w:pPr><w:rPr><w:lang w:val="en-GB"/></w:rPr></w:pPr></w:p><w:p w14:paraId="6D6CA7C8" w14:textId="65CA5BBE" w:rsidR="00D57C35" w:rsidRDefault="00D57C35"><w:pPr><w:rPr><w:b/><w:bCs/><w:lang w:val="en-GB"/></w:rPr></w:pPr><w:r w:rsidRPr="00D57C35"><w:rPr><w:b/><w:bCs/><w:lang w:val="en-GB"/></w:rPr><w:t xml:space="preserve">The </w:t></w:r><w:r><w:rPr><w:b/><w:bCs/><w:lang w:val="en-GB"/></w:rPr><w:t>L</w:t></w:r><w:r w:rsidRPr="00D57C35"><w:rPr><w:b/><w:bCs/><w:lang w:val="en-GB"/></w:rPr><w:t xml:space="preserve">ast </w:t></w:r><w:r><w:rPr><w:b/><w:bCs/><w:lang w:val="en-GB"/></w:rPr><w:t>L</w:t></w:r><w:r w:rsidRPr="00D57C35"><w:rPr><w:b/><w:bCs/><w:lang w:val="en-GB"/></w:rPr><w:t xml:space="preserve">ight of </w:t></w:r><w:r><w:rPr><w:b/><w:bCs/><w:lang w:val="en-GB"/></w:rPr><w:t>D</w:t></w:r><w:r w:rsidRPr="00D57C35"><w:rPr><w:b/><w:bCs/><w:lang w:val="en-GB"/></w:rPr><w:t>ivinity</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p w14:paraId="56527492" w14:textId="51A96552" w:rsidR="00D57C35" w:rsidRDefault="00D57C35"><w:pPr><w:rPr><w