interactive effects like snow, music, and photo capture for a joyful experience.</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p w14:paraId="4961C075" w14:textId="77777777" w:rsidR="00D57C35" w:rsidRDefault="00D57C35"/><w:p w14:paraId="7F5AA535" w14:textId="77777777" w:rsidR="00D57C35" w:rsidRDefault="00D57C35"/><w:p w14:paraId="12207864" w14:textId="395D29DA" w:rsidR="00D57C35" w:rsidRDefault="00D57C35"><w:pPr><w:rPr><w:b/><w:bCs/></w:rPr></w:pPr><w:r w:rsidRPr="00D57C35"><w:rPr><w:b/><w:bCs/></w:rPr><w:t>AR Storybook - The Three Little Pigs</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p w14:paraId="30B23903" w14:textId="0C9B47A3" w:rsidR="00D57C35" w:rsidRDefault="00D57C35"><w:r w:rsidRPr="00D57C35"><w:t xml:space="preserve">This AR interactive storybook, developed using Unity and Vuforia, is designed for children aged 7 to 12 and is based on The Three Little Pigs. The storybook includes interactive </w:t></w:r><w:proofErr w:type="gramStart"/><w:r w:rsidRPr="00D57C35"><w:t>mini-games</w:t></w:r><w:proofErr w:type="gramEnd"/><w:r w:rsidRPr="00D57C35"><w:t xml:space="preserve"> such as building houses, facing the wolf, and answering quiz questions, allowing children to learn moral values through fun and engaging gameplay.</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p w14:paraId="58A5732D" w14:textId="26A54BF7" w:rsidR="00D57C35" w:rsidRDefault="00D57C35"><w:pPr><w:rPr><w:lang w:val="en-GB"/></w:rPr></w:pPr><w:hyperlink r:id="rId12" w:history="1"><w:r w:rsidRPr="001577FB"><w:rPr><w:rStyle w:val="Hyperlink"/><w:lang w:val="en-GB"/></w:rPr><w:t>https://youtu.be/Ubvhfanhr98</w:t></w:r></w:hyperlink></w:p><w:p w14:paraId="1C3DF5DB" w14:textId="77777777" w:rsidR="00D57C35" w:rsidRDefault="00D57C35"><w:pPr><w:rPr><w:lang w:val="en-GB"/></w:rPr></w:pPr></w:p><w:p w14:paraId="3809C0A7" w14:textId="3323CA72" w:rsidR="00D57C35" w:rsidRDefault="00D57C35"><w:pPr><w:rPr><w:u w:val="single"/><w:lang w:val="en-GB"/></w:rPr></w:pPr><w:r w:rsidRPr="00D57C35"><w:rPr><w:u w:val="single"/><w:lang w:val="en-GB"/></w:rPr><w:t>VR</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p w14:paraId="2C2B24A3" w14:textId="6BFEB6EF" w:rsidR="00D57C35" w:rsidRDefault="00D57C35"><w:pPr><w:rPr><w:b/><w:bCs/></w:rPr></w:pPr><w:proofErr w:type="gramStart"/><w:r w:rsidRPr="00D57C35"><w:rPr><w:b/><w:bCs/></w:rPr><w:t>Escape</w:t></w:r><w:proofErr w:type="gramEnd"/><w:r w:rsidRPr="00D57C35"><w:rPr><w:b/><w:bCs/></w:rPr><w:t xml:space="preserve"> the Room</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p w14:paraId="1BD10F27" w14:textId="209927B5" w:rsidR="00D57C35" w:rsidRDefault="00D57C35"><w:r w:rsidRPr="00D57C35"><w:t>Escape the Room is a puzzle-based game where players must explore the environment, find hidden clues, and solve puzzles to unlock the door and escape. The game challenges players’ observation skills, logic, and problem-solving abilities through immersive and interactive gameplay.</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p w14:paraId="17080D05" w14:textId="77777777" w:rsidR="00D57C35" w:rsidRDefault="00D57C35"/><w:p w14:paraId="2967FA5E" w14:textId="763F13F8" w:rsidR="00D57C35" w:rsidRDefault="00D57C35"><w:pPr><w:rPr><w:b/><w:bCs/></w:rPr></w:pPr><w:r w:rsidRPr="00D57C35"><w:rPr><w:b/><w:bCs/></w:rPr><w:t>Survival Island</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p w14:paraId="4E73572C" w14:textId="3CC386B2" w:rsidR="00D57C35" w:rsidRDefault="00D57C35"><w:r w:rsidRPr="00D57C35"><w:lastRenderedPageBreak/><w:t>Survival Island is an educational survival game where players learn basic survival knowledge through gameplay. The story begins with a shipwreck, leaving the player stranded on an unknown island with limited resources. Players must collect food and water, manage hunger and thirst, and learn survival skills such as identifying edible resources and boiling seawater. After completing key tasks, players travel to a larger island with richer resources, new animals, and potential dangers like poisonous plants. By exploring, learning, and making the right decisions, players complete the final mission and escape the island safely.</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p w14:paraId="2AC26DC5" w14:textId="77777777" w:rsidR="00D57C35" w:rsidRDefault="00D57C35"/><w:p w14:paraId="33934144" w14:textId="2E72DB57" w:rsidR="00D57C35" w:rsidRDefault="00D57C35"><w:pPr><w:rPr><w:u w:val="single"/></w:rPr></w:pPr><w:r w:rsidRPr="00D57C35"><w:rPr><w:u w:val="single"/></w:rPr><w:t>Animation</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p w14:paraId="41865000" w14:textId="5436A1B4" w:rsidR="00D57C35" w:rsidRDefault="00D57C35"><w:pPr><w:rPr><w:b/><w:bCs/></w:rPr></w:pPr><w:r w:rsidRPr="00D57C35"><w:rPr><w:b/><w:bCs/></w:rPr><w:t>Emo</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p w14:paraId="2EB3A9CB" w14:textId="7D0DACF7" w:rsidR="00D57C35" w:rsidRDefault="00D57C35"><w:r w:rsidRPr="00D57C35"><w:t>Lily is a talented girl who grows up under extreme academic pressure from her parents. Overwhelmed by stress and emotional pain, she begins to lose herself and faces a dark inner struggle. Trapped between reality and her unconscious mind, Lily reaches a breaking point that leads to a life-changing moment.</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p w14:paraId="21744452" w14:textId="77777777" w:rsidR="00D57C35" w:rsidRDefault="00D57C35"/><w:p w14:paraId="0069E18B" w14:textId="0876903F" w:rsidR="00D57C35" w:rsidRDefault="00D57C35"><w:pPr><w:rPr><w:b/><w:bCs/></w:rPr></w:pPr><w:proofErr w:type="spellStart"/><w:r w:rsidRPr="00D57C35"><w:rPr><w:b/><w:bCs/></w:rPr><w:t>Meowtivation</w:t></w:r><w:proofErr w:type="spellEnd"/><w:r w:rsidRPr="00D57C35"><w:rPr><w:b/><w:bCs/></w:rPr><w:t xml:space="preserve"> Journey</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p w14:paraId="0B91CDD2" w14:textId="44BCFD0A" w:rsidR="00D57C35" w:rsidRDefault="00D57C35"><w:r w:rsidRPr="00D57C35"><w:t xml:space="preserve">This story follows Lily, a young girl who wakes up in a hospital after a suicide attempt. She is drawn into a mysterious Cat Kingdom by a black cat, where she experiences warmth, joy, and companionship. When </w:t></w:r><w:proofErr w:type="gramStart"/><w:r w:rsidRPr="00D57C35"><w:t>darkness</w:t></w:r><w:proofErr w:type="gramEnd"/><w:r w:rsidRPr="00D57C35"><w:t xml:space="preserve"> from her past and inner pain returns, Lily is forced to confront her depression. With the support of the cats, she finds the courage to accept herself and regain hope. She later wakes up in the hospital, unsure whether the Cat Kingdom was real or a dream, but carrying newfound strength and hope in her heart.</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p w14:paraId="14FD2690" w14:textId="68704FC6" w:rsidR="00D57C35" w:rsidRDefault="00DA66AB"><w:hyperlink r:id="rId13" w:history="1"><w:r w:rsidRPr="001577FB"><w:rPr><w:rStyle w:val="Hyperlink"/></w:rPr><w:t>https://youtu.be/yg2g49rY1Ks</w:t></w:r></w:hyperlink></w:p><w:p w14:paraId="4824AA9B" w14:textId="77777777" w:rsidR="00D57C35" w:rsidRPr="00D57C35" w:rsidRDefault="00D57C35"/><w:p w14:paraId="715410C5" w14:textId="5EF03DF9" w:rsidR="00D57C35" w:rsidRDefault="00D57C35"><w:pPr><w:rPr><w:b/><w:bCs/></w:rPr></w:pPr><w:r w:rsidRPr="00D57C35"><w:rPr><w:b/><w:bCs/></w:rPr><w:t>Scissor and Pencil</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p w14:paraId="4EE638A3" w14:textId="35F9F0CA" w:rsidR="00D57C35" w:rsidRDefault="00D57C35"><w:pPr><w:rPr><w:lang w:val="en-GB"/></w:rPr></w:pPr><w:hyperlink r:id="rId14" w:history="1"><w:r w:rsidRPr="001577FB"><w:rPr><w:rStyle w:val="Hyperlink"/><w:lang w:val="en-GB"/></w:rPr><w:t>https://youtu.be/bF8xCIKoJio</w:t></w:r></w:hyperlink></w:p><w:p w14:paraId="4BBD8BE1" w14:textId="77777777" w:rsidR="00D57C35" w:rsidRDefault="00D57C35"><w:pPr><w:rPr><w:lang w:val="en-GB"/></w:rPr></w:pPr></w:p><w:p w14:paraId="57C14FA3" w14:textId="1A6A004D" w:rsidR="00D57C35" w:rsidRDefault="00D57C35"><w:pPr><w:rPr><w:b/><w:bCs/></w:rPr></w:pPr><w:r w:rsidRPr="00D57C35"><w:rPr><w:b/><w:bCs/></w:rPr><w:t>Human and Animal Walk and Run Cycle</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p w14:paraId="072F5E5B" w14:textId="30EB761D" w:rsidR="00D57C35" w:rsidRDefault="00D57C35"><w:pPr><w:rPr><w:lang w:val="en-GB"/></w:rPr></w:pPr><w:hyperlink r:id="rId15" w:history="1"><w:r w:rsidRPr="001577FB"><w:rPr><w:rStyle w:val="Hyperlink"/><w:lang w:val="en-GB"/></w:rPr><w:t>https://youtu.be/xja1nG_-4zg</w:t></w:r></w:hyperlink></w:p><w:p w14:paraId="09FB95F5" w14:textId="77777777" w:rsidR="00D57C35" w:rsidRDefault="00D57C35"><w:pPr><w:rPr><w:lang w:val="en-GB"/></w:rPr></w:pPr></w:p><w:p w14:paraId="440F43B7" w14:textId="3885938C" w:rsidR="00D57C35" w:rsidRDefault="00D57C35"><w:pPr><w:rPr><w:b/><w:bCs/></w:rPr></w:pPr><w:r w:rsidRPr="00D57C35"><w:rPr><w:b/><w:bCs/></w:rPr><w:t>The Alley Fight</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p w14:paraId="5B067DBA" w14:textId="3674341A" w:rsidR="00D57C35" w:rsidRDefault="00D57C35"><w:r w:rsidRPr="00D57C35"><w:t xml:space="preserve">This animation tells the story of a young man and his sick mother living in a poor house in a dark cyberpunk alley. One day, a violent man comes to demand protection money and challenges the young man to a fight when they cannot pay. Although the young man is weak, he chooses to fight </w:t></w:r><w:r w:rsidRPr="00D57C35"><w:lastRenderedPageBreak/><w:t>to protect his mother and their home. When he is about to lose, his mother bravely saves him by using an old gun, showing her love and courage despite her illness.</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p w14:paraId="3AA504C5" w14:textId="0D301FE2" w:rsidR="00D57C35" w:rsidRDefault="00D57C35"><w:pPr><w:rPr><w:lang w:val="en-GB"/></w:rPr></w:pPr><w:hyperlink r:id="rId16" w:history="1"><w:r w:rsidRPr="001577FB"><w:rPr><w:rStyle w:val="Hyperlink"/><w:lang w:val="en-GB"/></w:rPr><w:t>https://youtu.be/aWnp2ja4FPM</w:t></w:r></w:hyperlink></w:p><w:p w14:paraId="03CBE9DB" w14:textId="77777777" w:rsidR="00D57C35" w:rsidRDefault="00D57C35"><w:pPr><w:rPr><w:lang w:val="en-GB"/></w:rPr></w:pPr></w:p><w:p w14:paraId="68307892" w14:textId="51BC30B1" w:rsidR="00D57C35" w:rsidRPr="00D57C35" w:rsidRDefault="00D57C35"><w:pPr><w:rPr><w:u w:val="single"/><w:lang w:val="en-GB"/></w:rPr></w:pPr><w:r w:rsidRPr="00D57C35"><w:rPr><w:u w:val="single"/><w:lang w:val="en-GB"/></w:rPr><w:t>Modelling</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p w14:paraId="40A8DA85" w14:textId="502658F0" w:rsidR="00D57C35" w:rsidRDefault="00D57C35"><w:pPr><w:rPr><w:b/><w:bCs/></w:rPr></w:pPr><w:r w:rsidRPr="00D57C35"><w:rPr><w:b/><w:bCs/></w:rPr><w:t>Study Room Modelling</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p w14:paraId="25B90548" w14:textId="77777777" w:rsidR="00DA66AB" w:rsidRDefault="00DA66AB"><w:pPr><w:rPr><w:b/><w:bCs/></w:rPr></w:pPr></w:p><w:p w14:paraId="65505F0F" w14:textId="67D98E7E" w:rsidR="00DA66AB" w:rsidRDefault="00DA66AB"><w:pPr><w:rPr><w:u w:val="single"/></w:rPr></w:pPr><w:r w:rsidRPr="00DA66AB"><w:rPr><w:u w:val="single"/></w:rPr><w:t>Video</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p w14:paraId="4638F884" w14:textId="14C515FB" w:rsidR="00DA66AB" w:rsidRDefault="00DA66AB"><w:pPr><w:rPr><w:b/><w:bCs/></w:rPr></w:pPr><w:r w:rsidRPr="00DA66AB"><w:rPr><w:b/><w:bCs/></w:rPr><w:t>Love Story</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p w14:paraId="68EE889A" w14:textId="65D06B6C" w:rsidR="00DA66AB" w:rsidRDefault="00DA66AB"><w:r w:rsidRPr="00DA66AB"><w:t>Love Story is a short story about a boy who gathers his courage to confess his feelings to a girl he likes. The story follows his emotional journey from nervousness and fear of rejection to happiness and shyness.</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p w14:paraId="2EAF9853" w14:textId="5933490C" w:rsidR="00DA66AB" w:rsidRDefault="00DA66AB"><w:pPr><w:rPr><w:lang w:val="en-GB"/></w:rPr></w:pPr><w:hyperlink r:id="rId17" w:history="1"><w:r w:rsidRPr="001577FB"><w:rPr><w:rStyle w:val="Hyperlink"/><w:lang w:val="en-GB"/></w:rPr><w:t>https://youtu.be/DuMxHbPrQz8</w:t></w:r></w:hyperlink></w:p><w:p w14:paraId="147801EA" w14:textId="77777777" w:rsidR="00DA66AB" w:rsidRDefault="00DA66AB"><w:pPr><w:rPr><w:lang w:val="en-GB"/></w:rPr></w:pPr></w:p><w:p w14:paraId="7B75DB34" w14:textId="12B1CE63" w:rsidR="00DA66AB" w:rsidRDefault="00DA66AB"><w:pPr><w:rPr><w:b/><w:bCs/></w:rPr></w:pPr><w:r w:rsidRPr="00DA66AB"><w:rPr><w:b/><w:bCs/></w:rPr><w:t>Batu Nisan: The Last Carver</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p w14:paraId="7BB9AD74" w14:textId="7A17212A" w:rsidR="00DA66AB" w:rsidRDefault="00DA66AB"><w:r w:rsidRPr="00DA66AB"><w:t xml:space="preserve">Batu Nisan: The Last Carver is a documentary about the disappearing art of traditional tombstone carving. It follows Mr. </w:t></w:r><w:proofErr w:type="spellStart"/><w:r w:rsidRPr="00DA66AB"><w:t>Kuah</w:t></w:r><w:proofErr w:type="spellEnd"/><w:r w:rsidRPr="00DA66AB"><w:t>, a Chinese craftsman who creates tombstones for Malay and Indian communities, highlighting the complex carving process, his unique workplace, and the importance of preserving this fading cultural heritage.</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p w14:paraId="73E66850" w14:textId="11DC12A8" w:rsidR="00DA66AB" w:rsidRDefault="00DA66AB"><w:pPr><w:rPr><w:lang w:val="en-GB"/></w:rPr></w:pPr><w:hyperlink r:id="rId18" w:history="1"><w:r w:rsidRPr="001577FB"><w:rPr><w:rStyle w:val="Hyperlink"/><w:lang w:val="en-GB"/></w:rPr><w:t>https://youtu.be/DuMxHbPrQz8</w:t></w:r></w:hyperlink></w:p><w:p w14:paraId="092A9D94" w14:textId="77777777" w:rsidR="00DA66AB" w:rsidRDefault="00DA66AB"><w:pPr><w:rPr><w:lang w:val="en-GB"/></w:rPr></w:pPr></w:p><w:p w14:paraId="02EC3DC6" w14:textId="1E5310F7" w:rsidR="00DA66AB" w:rsidRDefault="00DA66AB"><w:pPr><w:rPr><w:b/><w:bCs/></w:rPr></w:pPr><w:r w:rsidRPr="00DA66AB"><w:rPr><w:b/><w:bCs/></w:rPr><w:t>HAPPY birthday?</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p w14:paraId="3446AD02" w14:textId="36332E95" w:rsidR="00DA66AB" w:rsidRDefault="00DA66AB"><w:r w:rsidRPr="00DA66AB"><w:t>“HAPPY Birthday?” is a short film that takes place during an online group meeting. While discussing an assignment, strange moments begin to occur as voices from the iPad blur the line between reality and imagination. In the end, the tension is revealed to be part of a carefully planned birthday surprise prepared by her teammates outside the door.</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p w14:paraId="208BE327" w14:textId="31091D1F" w:rsidR="00DA66AB" w:rsidRDefault="00DA66AB"><w:pPr><w:rPr><w:lang w:val="en-GB"/></w:rPr></w:pPr><w:hyperlink r:id="rId19" w:history="1"><w:r w:rsidRPr="001577FB"><w:rPr><w:rStyle w:val="Hyperlink"/><w:lang w:val="en-GB"/></w:rPr><w:t>https://youtu.be/te2-JjwVGDg</w:t></w:r></w:hyperlink></w:p><w: